# Question: what happens when someone tunes a channel?
...@system/theme

direction: down

viewer: Someone tunes in {class: audience}
file: Your media file\nread directly {class: service}

packager: Channel packager {
  class: boundary
  schedule: Schedule\nwhat airs now? {class: loomarr}
  encoder: ffmpeg\none process per item {class: loomarr}
  slate: Slate\nif an item is late {class: service}
  timeline: Timeline\n1 s segments, 15 min window {class: loomarr}
  schedule -> encoder: next item {class: hot}
  encoder -> timeline: fragments {class: hot}
  slate -> timeline {class: flow}
}

out: One encode, two outputs {
  class: zone
  hls: HLS\nbrowsers, TV app {class: audience}
  ts: MPEG-TS\nEmby or Jellyfin tuner {class: audience}
}

viewer -> packager.schedule: first tune starts it {class: hot}
file -> packager.encoder {class: flow}
packager.timeline -> out.hls {class: hot}
packager.timeline -> out.ts {class: hot}
